# Technical Scanner API examples

@TechnicalScanner.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5289

### Latest scan summary
GET {{TechnicalScanner.Api_HostAddress}}/api/scanner/latest

### Screener
GET {{TechnicalScanner.Api_HostAddress}}/api/scanner/screener?country=US&signal=BMSB_BELOW&sort=compositeScoreDesc&page=1&pageSize=50

### Tickers (paginated)
GET {{TechnicalScanner.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickers?country=US&page=1&pageSize=25&sort=symbolAsc

### Indicator history
GET {{TechnicalScanner.Api_HostAddress}}/api/indicators/history?ticker=AAPL&indicatorCode=RSI_14_W

### Breadth history
GET {{TechnicalScanner.Api_HostAddress}}/api/breadth/history?metricCode=SMA_200_D_ABOVE_PCT

### Signal matches
GET {{TechnicalScanner.Api_HostAddress}}/api/scanner/signals?signal=RSI_D_OVERSOLD&country=US

### Composite scores
GET {{TechnicalScanner.Api_HostAddress}}/api/scanner/scores?scoreCode=DEEP_PULLBACK&sort=scoreDesc
